      "description": "Square cream card with copper top border, serif title, italic copper question, degree tags.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-prog\"><div class=\"ds-prog-num\">I</div><h3 class=\"ds-prog-title\">Philosophy</h3><p class=\"ds-prog-q\">What does it mean to know?</p><p class=\"ds-prog-desc\">Graduate study in reformational philosophy, engaged with contemporary thought.</p><span class=\"ds-tag\">MA</span> <span class=\"ds-tag\">PhD</span></article>",
